      "correctAnswer": 0,
      "persona": "Hacktivist",
      "taskMessage": "<b>Priya Nandan:</b> I do not care what Halloway's policy says about who may copy that zone. Policies are what people show auditors.\n\nI care what their nameserver actually does when a machine it has never met asks for the whole list, because whatever comes back has been available to anyone who thought to ask for it.",
